WEBVTT

00:11.060 --> 00:13.980
[Fenglinwan]

00:24.440 --> 00:25.570
Here is my bank card.

00:26.670 --> 00:28.070
The PIN is your birthday.

00:29.070 --> 00:30.670
This is an accident insurance policy.

00:30.670 --> 00:32.270
You are the beneficiary too.

00:34.560 --> 00:35.150
Yibo.

00:35.920 --> 00:36.780
What happened?

00:37.070 --> 00:38.470
Can't you tell me?

00:38.710 --> 00:40.710
You've been restless these past 2 days.

00:40.710 --> 00:41.320
Qi,

00:41.600 --> 00:43.060
please don't ask me, okay?

00:43.280 --> 00:44.200
Just remember,

00:45.390 --> 00:46.730
everything I've done

00:48.520 --> 00:49.350
is because

00:51.600 --> 00:52.660
I love you too much.

00:57.110 --> 00:58.390
We must meet tonight.

00:59.000 --> 01:00.800
I have just one question for you.

01:20.590 --> 01:21.920
Why did you come so fast?

02:45.430 --> 02:49.210
[Born with Luck]

02:49.260 --> 02:52.180
[Episode 6]

02:52.260 --> 02:54.530
[Loyalty]

02:54.570 --> 02:56.270
[Forensic Lab]

02:59.470 --> 03:00.960
Our forensic doctor's surname is
Chen, right?

03:00.960 --> 03:01.430
Yes.

03:01.800 --> 03:02.520
Just call him Mr. Chen.

03:02.520 --> 03:02.850
Okay.

03:03.910 --> 03:04.680
He's a nice guy.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.470
Very easygoing.

03:05.470 --> 03:05.960
Okay.

03:09.800 --> 03:10.330
Mr. Chen.

03:17.180 --> 03:18.500
On Ye Jian's body,

03:17.530 --> 03:20.770
[Forensic Lab]

03:18.910 --> 03:21.110
there are a total of 6 major stab wounds.

03:21.680 --> 03:22.360
The murder weapon

03:22.360 --> 03:23.740
is a dagger-like knife.

03:24.710 --> 03:25.970
In addition, his ribs

03:26.079 --> 03:26.840
were fractured

03:26.840 --> 03:28.240
due to multiple impacts.

03:29.470 --> 03:31.180
Judging from my experience,

03:31.710 --> 03:33.000
Ye Jian should have been

03:33.000 --> 03:34.790
hit by a vehicle first,

03:35.470 --> 03:37.070
and then stabbed by a dagger.

03:38.630 --> 03:39.400
However,

03:39.470 --> 03:41.530
the cuts on his body are very strange.

03:42.470 --> 03:43.710
There are both upward

03:43.750 --> 03:46.000
and downward directions
for the blade marks.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.360
It doesn't matter if there is one murderer

03:47.360 --> 03:48.490
or multiple of them—

03:48.800 --> 03:50.200
this doesn't make sense.

03:52.470 --> 03:53.280
I have been

03:53.400 --> 03:55.520
a forensic doctor for nearly 20 years,

03:55.520 --> 03:56.920
and this is the first time

03:56.960 --> 03:59.090
I dare not make a complete conclusion.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.560
Do you need the Provincial Department

04:01.560 --> 04:03.560
to send a forensic team over to help?

04:06.750 --> 04:07.480
Chief Zhang.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.690
What do you mean by that?

04:11.430 --> 04:11.960
I...

04:12.000 --> 04:13.080
I have been a

04:13.120 --> 04:14.630
forensic doctor for nearly 20 years.

04:14.630 --> 04:15.800
In 1995,

04:15.840 --> 04:18.190
I became a forensic doctor
right after graduating from college.

04:18.190 --> 04:19.720
Do you know how hard it was

04:19.750 --> 04:21.070
to get into college back then?

04:21.070 --> 04:24.310
It was like millions of soldiers
crossing a single log bridge.

04:24.310 --> 04:24.920
Let me tell you,

04:24.920 --> 04:26.050
my grades back then.

04:26.120 --> 04:26.680
Chinese.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.390
-My Chinese language grade—
-No.

04:28.390 --> 04:30.120
I'm not doubting your ability.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.120
I'm just thinking they could

04:31.120 --> 04:31.800
come and assist you.

04:31.800 --> 04:33.530
Because I saw your leg seems...

04:34.430 --> 04:35.870
It's not my leg—

04:36.000 --> 04:37.000
it's my waist!

04:37.070 --> 04:38.800
It's a lumbar disc herniation.

04:39.360 --> 04:40.920
Does it have anything to do
with the autopsy results?

04:40.920 --> 04:41.750
Mr. Chen.

04:41.800 --> 04:42.560
Say no more.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.070
We are all on the same side.

04:44.070 --> 04:45.270
Chief Zhang is also doing this
to solve the case.

04:45.270 --> 04:45.750
Right?

04:46.040 --> 04:46.430
Yes.

04:47.430 --> 04:49.600
Chief Zhang has his own way
of solving cases.

04:49.600 --> 04:51.130
I am greatly inspired.

04:52.040 --> 04:53.370
No wonder the media says

04:53.480 --> 04:54.950
you are a brilliant detective.

04:54.950 --> 04:55.920
But if you ask me,

04:57.190 --> 04:58.900
solving Ye Jian's case

04:59.390 --> 05:02.050
will truly make you
a real brilliant detective.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.800
His self-esteem is quite high.

05:15.800 --> 05:17.190
That's his only flaw.

05:31.240 --> 05:31.950
East New Town

05:31.950 --> 05:33.680
will issue the tender within this month

05:33.680 --> 05:34.680
for 33 acres of land.

05:34.680 --> 05:36.600
Half will be for office and commercial use,

05:36.600 --> 05:38.390
and the other
half is for residential facilities.

05:38.390 --> 05:40.270
The base price
for the bidding is 600 million.

05:40.270 --> 05:42.270
There are financial subsidies too.

05:42.310 --> 05:44.390
According to
the financial department's calculation,

05:44.390 --> 05:46.070
the profit from selling
the residential buildings alone

05:46.070 --> 05:47.180
can cover the cost.

05:47.630 --> 05:48.760
As for the remaining

05:48.920 --> 05:50.070
office and commercial buildings,

05:50.070 --> 05:51.750
the hundreds of millions
of rent every year

05:51.750 --> 05:53.210
are basically free money.

05:53.270 --> 05:53.950
Jianren.

05:54.720 --> 05:56.120
Rongcheng's recent accounts

05:56.120 --> 05:57.320
don't look very good.

05:57.560 --> 05:59.010
If we don't get that land,

05:59.310 --> 06:01.240
things won't be easy for us either.

06:02.000 --> 06:03.000
So have you found out

06:03.000 --> 06:04.260
where Fang Yong lives?

06:04.430 --> 06:05.070
Yes.

06:06.160 --> 06:08.480
But what should we give him?

06:10.430 --> 06:13.090
Doesn't Fang Yong
call himself a man of culture?

06:13.920 --> 06:16.450
We need to deal with him
in a cultured way then.

06:16.870 --> 06:19.360
Start with antiques and calligraphy.

06:28.190 --> 06:28.600
Zheng,

06:28.680 --> 06:29.590
you're late today.

06:29.590 --> 06:31.510
Traffic was a bit heavy today.

06:31.630 --> 06:32.070
Is that so?

06:32.070 --> 06:32.810
I'm leaving.

06:32.870 --> 06:33.400
Bye-bye.

06:35.159 --> 06:36.200
Ren!

06:36.270 --> 06:36.950
How do you have time

06:36.950 --> 06:38.180
to come here?

06:38.480 --> 06:39.280
Open the door.

06:46.630 --> 06:47.120
Ren,

06:47.600 --> 06:48.400
have some tea.

07:00.180 --> 07:01.920
I want to buy a calligraphy piece.

07:01.920 --> 07:02.560
By whom?

07:03.480 --> 07:04.270
Gan Yueran.

07:06.070 --> 07:07.130
You mean Yu Yueran?

07:12.680 --> 07:13.810
That's about right.

07:14.750 --> 07:15.830
On the market,

07:15.950 --> 07:18.160
there are many of Yu Yueran's
calligraphy works—

07:18.160 --> 07:19.800
there are fakes and there are real ones.

07:19.800 --> 07:20.980
Expensive ones cost 500,000,

07:20.980 --> 07:22.650
while cheap ones are only 5,000.

07:22.650 --> 07:23.380
Brother Ren,

07:23.750 --> 07:25.010
which kind do you want?

07:29.480 --> 07:30.740
I want the 500,000 one.

07:35.300 --> 07:35.659
[A stone at the scene
with "Yi'ang" written on it]

07:35.659 --> 07:37.120
[Zhang Yi'ang]

07:36.159 --> 07:36.600
Chief.

07:37.720 --> 07:38.890
Hasn't this case been cleared up?

07:38.240 --> 07:40.220
[Informant?]

07:38.920 --> 07:39.630
It has nothing to do with Chief Zhang.

07:39.630 --> 07:40.360
Why is his photo still there?

07:40.360 --> 07:41.300
Take it down right now.

07:40.400 --> 07:41.960
[Zhang Yi'ang]

07:41.430 --> 07:42.510
Don't, don't.

07:41.960 --> 07:44.030
[Ye Jian's murdered]

07:42.800 --> 07:43.930
Just leave it there.

07:45.070 --> 07:46.390
Because this is our

07:46.480 --> 07:47.940
only clear clue right now.

07:48.270 --> 07:49.400
Just leave it there.

07:49.480 --> 07:50.000
Yes.

07:50.480 --> 07:50.830
Come.

07:50.870 --> 07:51.330
Yi'ang.

07:52.870 --> 07:53.560
You will be

07:54.240 --> 07:55.790
in full charge of this case.

07:56.070 --> 07:56.870
How to solve it

07:57.159 --> 07:57.820
is up to you.

07:59.570 --> 08:00.820
[Police]

08:20.070 --> 08:20.750
I...

08:21.750 --> 08:22.510
I think...

08:27.600 --> 08:28.000
The...

08:31.750 --> 08:33.750
The most important

08:35.630 --> 08:37.190
clue should still be at

08:37.270 --> 08:38.240
the crime scene.

08:38.240 --> 08:38.960
We have already investigated

08:38.960 --> 08:40.150
the scene several times.

08:40.150 --> 08:41.630
We found footprints along the way,

08:41.630 --> 08:42.480
but we can't be sure yet

08:42.480 --> 08:43.710
if they belong to the suspect.

08:43.710 --> 08:45.980
[Lu Zheng car accident]
[Informant]

08:43.840 --> 08:44.270
Good.

08:46.000 --> 08:48.420
[Paid murder]

08:48.440 --> 08:54.900
[Ye Jian's murdered]

08:49.870 --> 08:50.720
Before Captain Ye passed away,

08:50.720 --> 08:52.120
did he have any conflicts

08:52.510 --> 08:53.370
before he died?

08:53.720 --> 08:54.720
It's possible.

08:54.960 --> 08:55.820
As far as I know,

08:55.910 --> 08:56.360
no.

08:59.840 --> 09:00.390
Okay.

09:02.240 --> 09:03.520
Then what about his

09:03.670 --> 09:04.270
computer,

09:04.670 --> 09:05.320
phone,

09:05.360 --> 09:06.510
apps, WeChat...

09:06.550 --> 09:08.190
His files, WeChat, QQ,

09:08.270 --> 09:09.630
and Taobao browsing history—

09:09.630 --> 09:10.750
we've checked them all.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.280
There was nothing special.

09:15.000 --> 09:16.200
What else have you done

09:16.200 --> 09:17.520
related to this?

09:17.550 --> 09:18.870
From the time Ye left the station

09:18.870 --> 09:19.600
to his murder,

09:19.600 --> 09:20.790
there were 5 hours.

09:21.080 --> 09:21.740
He appeared

09:21.900 --> 09:22.780
[Ye Jian's body location] [Ye Jian's car]

09:22.230 --> 09:23.910
at this intersection at the end,

09:23.910 --> 09:25.720
and couldn't be traced afterwards.

09:25.720 --> 09:26.180
Yi'ang.

09:26.790 --> 09:27.990
Are you giving a test?

09:29.150 --> 09:30.290
These guys

09:30.440 --> 09:31.840
are better than interns

09:31.870 --> 09:32.470
from the police academy, right?

09:32.470 --> 09:32.840
Yes.

09:33.110 --> 09:34.700
They know the basics.

09:34.870 --> 09:35.270
Of course.

09:35.270 --> 09:35.790
I...

09:35.910 --> 09:36.720
I didn't mean that.

09:36.720 --> 09:37.450
Chief Zhang,

09:38.270 --> 09:39.400
time is running out.

09:39.840 --> 09:40.440
Since we're

09:40.440 --> 09:41.630
going to work together,

09:41.630 --> 09:42.510
let's be clear.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.030
Okay.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.510
You are a brilliant detective.

09:45.510 --> 09:46.970
We can't compare with you.

09:47.080 --> 09:47.750
Don't say that.

09:47.750 --> 09:48.480
Then tell us,

09:48.510 --> 09:49.870
what should we do next?

09:50.000 --> 09:50.960
And what exactly?

09:50.960 --> 09:52.560
You can't possibly not know.

10:06.510 --> 10:07.940
[Ye Jian's murdered]

10:07.990 --> 10:09.210
[A stone at the scene
with "Yi'ang" written on it]

10:12.120 --> 10:13.760
[Yu Xiaofei] [Paid murderer]

10:13.760 --> 10:15.830
[Lu Zheng car accident]
[Informant] [Report letter]

10:26.020 --> 10:26.800
Chief.

10:27.360 --> 10:29.000
Before Captain Ye was murdered,

10:29.000 --> 10:29.600
he requested the files of a case

10:29.600 --> 10:30.770
handled by Chief Lu.

10:37.600 --> 10:38.950
To investigate Captain Ye's case,

10:37.990 --> 10:40.150
[Ye Jian's murdered]

10:39.320 --> 10:41.120
we have to start with Chief Lu's cases.

10:40.150 --> 10:41.240
[Lu Zheng car accident]
[Informant] [Report letter]

10:41.150 --> 10:41.550
Okay.

10:41.670 --> 10:42.960
Investigate Chief Lu's cases?

10:42.960 --> 10:43.550
How?

10:46.320 --> 10:48.520
We have to start with Captain Ye's case.

10:48.790 --> 10:49.390
You mean

10:49.440 --> 10:51.040
the two cases are connected?

10:53.270 --> 10:54.000
It's obvious

10:54.720 --> 10:56.180
that this is a closed loop.

10:58.840 --> 10:59.670
As long as we can find

10:59.670 --> 11:01.600
the connection point of this loop,

11:01.630 --> 11:02.270
we can

11:02.320 --> 11:04.120
move both cases at the same time.

11:05.390 --> 11:07.260
[Lu Zheng car accident]
[Ye Jian's murdered]

11:08.030 --> 11:09.030
I understand now.

11:09.390 --> 11:11.000
You want to merge the cases, right?

11:11.000 --> 11:12.930
Merging cases requires evidence.

11:18.360 --> 11:20.090
Have you been to Ye Jian's home?

11:20.550 --> 11:21.220
Have you?

11:21.320 --> 11:22.980
This is a very important clue.

11:23.240 --> 11:23.790
Yes.

11:24.840 --> 11:25.970
I led the team there.

11:27.510 --> 11:29.040
You went there personally?

11:30.270 --> 11:30.870
Of course.

11:31.550 --> 11:32.510
When I went there,

11:32.510 --> 11:34.080
I was in deep sorrow.

11:34.960 --> 11:36.390
If you go there again,

11:37.240 --> 11:39.300
you might find something different.

11:41.240 --> 11:41.640
Right.

11:44.260 --> 11:46.610
[Ye Jian's murdered]

11:54.750 --> 11:55.660
Is he out yet?

11:56.440 --> 11:57.300
Should be soon.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.800
This is Fang Yong's neighborhood.

12:00.080 --> 12:01.610
There's only one gate here.

12:01.840 --> 12:02.550
If he goes out,

12:02.550 --> 12:04.010
we'll definitely see him.

12:04.640 --> 12:05.830
Mr. Rong.

12:06.270 --> 12:07.940
Do you think it's appropriate

12:08.360 --> 12:10.090
for us to wait for him like this?

12:21.150 --> 12:23.410
[Fang Yong, Director of
East New Town's Administrative Committee]

12:33.870 --> 12:34.640
He's here.

12:44.030 --> 12:44.850
Mr. Fang.

12:47.540 --> 12:48.350
You are...

12:48.670 --> 12:49.720
Rongcheng Real Estate's

12:49.720 --> 12:50.320
Zhou Rong.

12:53.200 --> 12:54.110
Hello.

12:54.270 --> 12:55.330
What's the matter?

12:55.480 --> 12:56.340
It's like this.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.070
I

12:57.200 --> 12:58.600
just acquired a piece of calligraphy

12:58.600 --> 13:00.310
by Master Yu Yueran
from the Republic of China era.

13:00.310 --> 13:02.120
I heard you're an expert in this field,

13:02.120 --> 13:03.910
so I wanted to ask you to authenticate it.

13:03.910 --> 13:06.060
I wanted to visit you at your office,

13:06.270 --> 13:07.790
but I was afraid it might not look good.

13:07.790 --> 13:09.080
So I tried my luck here.

13:09.150 --> 13:10.680
And I actually ran into you.

13:10.870 --> 13:12.330
Yu Yueran's calligraphy?

13:12.600 --> 13:13.860
Where is it? Let me see.

13:13.870 --> 13:14.600
In the trunk.

13:14.750 --> 13:15.600
Hurry.

13:16.960 --> 13:17.440
This way.

13:17.440 --> 13:17.750
Okay.

13:17.750 --> 13:18.210
Please.

13:24.150 --> 13:24.610
Slowly.

13:40.250 --> 13:41.370
[Yu Yueran]

13:43.790 --> 13:44.270
Not bad.

13:45.870 --> 13:47.000
The frame is not bad.

13:47.670 --> 13:49.000
It's from Rong Bao Zhai.

13:50.790 --> 13:52.190
The calligraphy is fake.

13:54.840 --> 13:55.460
Fake?

13:55.630 --> 13:56.210
Yes,

13:56.480 --> 13:57.080
it's fake.

14:01.360 --> 14:02.480
As expected

14:02.550 --> 14:03.890
of an expert.

14:04.150 --> 14:04.760
Mr. Fang,

14:05.320 --> 14:07.050
since this calligraphy is fake

14:07.150 --> 14:08.010
and worthless,

14:08.200 --> 14:09.260
you can take it back

14:09.720 --> 14:11.050
and hang it on your wall.

14:11.720 --> 14:13.580
It really is fake.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.170
If I hang a fake

14:15.200 --> 14:16.780
on my wall,

14:17.150 --> 14:18.720
people will call me crazy.

14:20.870 --> 14:21.870
It really is fake?

14:22.080 --> 14:24.420
It's obviously fake.

14:25.080 --> 14:25.600
Ren,

14:26.150 --> 14:27.410
which kind do you want?

14:29.120 --> 14:30.380
I want the 500,000 one.

14:32.080 --> 14:32.750
But

14:34.790 --> 14:35.990
I only brought 5,000.

14:38.080 --> 14:38.810
Look at this,

14:38.870 --> 14:41.440
the characters are nothing like his.

14:41.750 --> 14:43.950
How dare one write Mr. Yu's name
on this.

14:44.000 --> 14:45.400
It couldn't be more fake.

14:47.270 --> 14:49.270
Where did you get something so fake?

14:55.600 --> 14:56.600
Mr. Fang, well...

14:57.000 --> 14:58.870
I just don't know much
about calligraphy and painting.

14:58.870 --> 14:59.790
It would be great
if I could have the opportunity

14:59.790 --> 15:00.930
to learn more about this

15:00.930 --> 15:01.790
from you.

15:07.670 --> 15:09.820
You stopped me halfway

15:10.080 --> 15:10.910
just to ask

15:10.960 --> 15:12.220
if this is real or fake?

15:16.230 --> 15:17.630
I also wanted to ask about

15:18.200 --> 15:20.270
the development policy
of the East New Town.

15:20.270 --> 15:22.110
Rongcheng is bidding too.

15:22.320 --> 15:22.840
See.

15:24.000 --> 15:24.510
See.

15:25.550 --> 15:26.200
I knew it.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.600
I hate you

15:28.630 --> 15:29.890
businessmen the most.

15:32.030 --> 15:34.720
You think you're smart
and play all kinds of tricks.

15:34.720 --> 15:35.360
I tell you,

15:36.000 --> 15:37.220
I, Fang,

15:37.320 --> 15:38.180
don't buy this.

15:41.390 --> 15:41.920
Mr. Fang.

15:43.000 --> 15:43.550
Mr. Fang!

15:44.720 --> 15:45.150
Mr...

15:46.030 --> 15:46.800
Mr. Fang!

15:46.590 --> 15:47.910
[Fake Yu Yueran calligraphy]

15:51.070 --> 15:56.310
[Fake Yu Yueran calligraphy]

15:51.390 --> 15:52.830
Mr. Rong, he's gone.

15:53.320 --> 15:54.240
I bought a fake

15:54.510 --> 15:55.240
for 500,000,

15:55.270 --> 15:57.120
and I almost gave it
as a first meeting gift.

15:57.120 --> 15:57.580
Well...

15:57.960 --> 15:59.630
I'll go settle this score
with Zheng Yongbing.

15:59.630 --> 16:01.390
What's the use of looking for him?

16:01.390 --> 16:01.920
Jianren,

16:02.720 --> 16:03.790
I normally turn a blind eye

16:03.790 --> 16:05.120
when you play your little tricks—

16:05.120 --> 16:05.850
forget them.

16:05.870 --> 16:06.550
But this is something important.

16:06.550 --> 16:08.350
How could you fool me with a fake?

16:08.750 --> 16:09.280
Mr. Rong.

16:13.150 --> 16:13.670
Drive.

16:15.960 --> 16:16.510
Mr. Rong,

16:16.790 --> 16:18.120
I haven't gotten on yet!

16:18.150 --> 16:18.820
Mr. Rong!

16:19.000 --> 16:19.480
I...

16:19.840 --> 16:20.370
Mr. Rong.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.390
The trunk is open!

16:28.440 --> 16:30.430
Ye is 39 this year.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.210
He's single.

16:31.550 --> 16:33.510
He was assigned an apartment in
the Public Security Bureau's

16:33.510 --> 16:34.840
family compound in his early years,

16:34.840 --> 16:36.500
and has lived here ever since.

16:37.320 --> 16:38.080
You must have found

16:38.080 --> 16:39.920
the key clue to Chief Lu's murder.

16:39.920 --> 16:41.720
You might not even realize it yourself,

16:41.720 --> 16:42.850
but it must be there.

16:43.120 --> 16:44.320
Where is the clue?

16:44.670 --> 16:45.800
On the second floor.

16:46.360 --> 16:47.440
On the second floor?

16:47.440 --> 16:49.700
Ye's house is on the second floor, Chief.

16:49.750 --> 16:50.610
Okay, let's go.

16:53.480 --> 16:53.870
Here.

17:22.720 --> 17:26.950
♪ Burning on its own
somewhere between haziness and clarity ♪

17:30.860 --> 17:37.120
♪ In the careless detail,
he touched the color ♪

17:39.200 --> 17:39.960
Why are you all following me?

17:39.960 --> 17:41.250
I'm just looking around.

17:41.250 --> 17:43.320
♪ The show starts getting interesting ♪

17:45.450 --> 17:47.570
♪ I wonder who's the real onlooker here ♪

17:50.130 --> 17:51.890
♪ Find the onlooker ♪

17:56.320 --> 17:59.090
♪ The chance is waiting patiently
in the bowl ♪

17:57.270 --> 17:57.750
Thanks.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.030
Put it on.

18:00.150 --> 18:01.400
♪ Who covered my eyes ♪

18:02.240 --> 18:03.950
♪ I'm full of ideas ♪

18:27.600 --> 18:28.960
♪ Oh, god ♪

18:30.650 --> 18:33.580
♪ Please give me some guidance ♪

18:34.690 --> 18:37.340
♪ Find the sleepy poet ♪

18:39.210 --> 18:40.660
♪ They are all guests ♪

18:46.510 --> 18:47.480
What are you doing?

18:47.480 --> 18:48.940
This is an important clue.

18:49.110 --> 18:49.750
As soon as Chief Zhang came in,

18:49.750 --> 18:51.200
he pulled it right off the wall.

18:51.200 --> 18:52.270
Even the nail was pulled out.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.400
Right, Chief Zhang?

18:57.720 --> 18:58.450
Chief Zhang.

18:58.680 --> 18:59.680
What's important

18:59.880 --> 19:00.880
about this photo?

19:17.070 --> 19:17.800
Chief Zhang,

19:18.550 --> 19:19.610
are you looking for

19:19.750 --> 19:20.590
something that shouldn't be

19:20.590 --> 19:21.850
in Captain Ye's house?

19:22.070 --> 19:22.680
Yes.

19:23.000 --> 19:23.960
What I am looking for now

19:23.960 --> 19:25.070
is something

19:25.110 --> 19:27.170
that Ye Jian wouldn't normally have.

19:31.920 --> 19:32.650
Chief Zhang,

19:33.240 --> 19:33.960
how did you know Ye...

19:33.960 --> 19:34.590
Shut up.

19:42.640 --> 19:43.370
Chief Zhang.

19:43.510 --> 19:45.070
Captain Ye was an upright person.

19:45.070 --> 19:45.830
He never made

19:45.880 --> 19:47.240
any disciplinary mistakes.

19:47.240 --> 19:48.070
How could there be

19:48.070 --> 19:49.930
anything that shouldn't be here?

19:51.110 --> 19:51.920
I can guarantee this:

19:51.920 --> 19:54.650
Captain Ye is absolutely
not that kind of person.

19:56.270 --> 19:58.530
There's definitely something going on.

20:12.720 --> 20:14.050
Did you find something?

20:16.160 --> 20:17.890
He's definitely never used it.

20:18.270 --> 20:19.270
Let me have a look.

20:21.350 --> 20:22.070
Bring it.

20:24.750 --> 20:25.280
Bring it.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.270
We found this

20:33.310 --> 20:35.030
when we searched the place last time.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.240
This card has no credit limit.

20:36.240 --> 20:37.200
But we checked the records,

20:37.200 --> 20:38.880
and it hasn't even been activated.

20:38.880 --> 20:40.200
He's a very cautious man.

20:40.200 --> 20:42.000
He rarely even attends
drinking gatherings.

20:42.000 --> 20:44.000
Why didn't you mention it last time?

20:45.110 --> 20:46.640
I was afraid if word got out,

20:46.750 --> 20:48.680
it would be bad for his reputation.

20:54.720 --> 20:55.450
Fenglinwan?

20:58.490 --> 21:00.420
[Spa Card]
[Fenglinwan VIP Exclusive]

20:59.920 --> 21:00.510
The slightly shorter one

21:00.510 --> 21:01.640
in the back

21:01.640 --> 21:02.890
is Lu Yibo.

21:03.160 --> 21:04.880
He's the manager of the biggest hotel

21:04.880 --> 21:06.160
in Sanjiangkou.

21:15.160 --> 21:16.760
Only by finding out the truth

21:18.110 --> 21:19.440
can we clear Ye's name.

21:31.550 --> 21:32.350
Captain Wang.

21:32.830 --> 21:34.160
Chief Zhang is amazing.

21:36.590 --> 21:37.720
He's got something.

21:38.560 --> 21:41.680
[Out of service;
do not climb]

21:41.790 --> 21:43.880
My poetry; my distant horizon.

21:43.920 --> 21:45.530
[My Poetry, My Faraway]

21:51.750 --> 21:53.590
Is this the highly corrupt official

21:53.590 --> 21:54.770
we went through so much trouble

21:54.770 --> 21:55.920
to find?

21:57.000 --> 21:58.580
He's still riding

21:58.640 --> 22:00.710
such a shitty bike in this day and age?

22:01.070 --> 22:03.070
Can't even afford an electric bike?

22:03.640 --> 22:05.800
That's such a sad life.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.350
Is this what
a highly corrupt official looks like?

22:08.350 --> 22:09.810
You are too inexperienced

22:10.000 --> 22:11.960
to see through their disguise.

22:12.720 --> 22:13.590
I'll teach you.

22:13.720 --> 22:15.650
Don't let his shitty bike fool you.

22:15.790 --> 22:17.440
This fatty is East New Town's

22:17.480 --> 22:19.110
Director of the Administrative Committee.

22:19.110 --> 22:20.110
The East New Town is known to be

22:20.110 --> 22:21.370
the next Sanjiangkou.

22:21.400 --> 22:22.480
This fatty is

22:22.510 --> 22:25.310
on an equal footing
with the mayor of Sanjiangkou City.

22:25.310 --> 22:26.240
The neighborhood he lives in—

22:26.240 --> 22:27.270
I checked the housing prices.

22:27.270 --> 22:28.600
It's at least 3 million.

22:33.070 --> 22:34.310
Well.

22:35.070 --> 22:36.340
At his age,

22:36.590 --> 22:38.680
buying a house with a mortgage
of 3 to 4 million

22:38.680 --> 22:39.830
is quite normal.

22:39.960 --> 22:41.480
Besides, if he bought it
a few years earlier,

22:41.480 --> 22:42.960
he wouldn't even need half of that.

22:42.960 --> 22:43.960
Then let me ask you:

22:43.960 --> 22:45.000
everyone with a status

22:45.000 --> 22:45.880
has a car.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.160
Given his status,

22:47.400 --> 22:48.920
is it normal for him to be riding

22:48.920 --> 22:49.720
a shitty bike to work?

22:49.720 --> 22:50.450
Yeah.

22:50.680 --> 22:51.830
This fatty is trying to lose weight
by riding a bike.

22:51.830 --> 22:52.240
Then why

22:52.240 --> 22:53.640
does he ride a shitty bike

22:53.680 --> 22:55.280
instead of getting a new one?

22:55.440 --> 22:56.300
He's used to it.

22:56.480 --> 22:57.920
He doesn't want to change the old one.

22:57.920 --> 22:58.550
Like me—

22:58.790 --> 23:00.160
I've been wearing this underwear
for 5 years

23:00.160 --> 23:01.160
and haven't changed it.

23:01.160 --> 23:02.360
I'm still wearing it.

23:03.070 --> 23:04.730
Don't show me your underwear.

23:07.790 --> 23:09.450
Look at the photos in the back.

23:09.920 --> 23:11.160
This is first-hand information I got

23:11.160 --> 23:12.550
from the newspaper publisher.

23:12.550 --> 23:14.440
Open your eyes wide and look carefully.

23:14.440 --> 23:15.270
Are the bikes he rides

23:15.270 --> 23:16.110
the same one?

23:20.310 --> 23:20.790
Bro.

23:21.160 --> 23:23.560
There's a game called spot the difference.

23:30.480 --> 23:32.590
They really are different.

23:32.720 --> 23:33.580
Over the years,

23:33.590 --> 23:34.400
he has changed

23:34.440 --> 23:36.070
at least 3 different bikes.

23:36.550 --> 23:38.990
A bike doesn't cost much.

23:39.110 --> 23:40.370
Those 3 shitty bikes

23:40.400 --> 23:41.990
are worth even less.

23:42.270 --> 23:43.350
The problem is,

23:43.750 --> 23:44.240
why does he

23:44.240 --> 23:45.970
always change to shitty bikes?

23:46.270 --> 23:47.750
And where did he find

23:47.790 --> 23:50.250
3 shitty The Forever bikes
from decades ago?

23:53.480 --> 23:56.030
He always rides a bike.

23:56.830 --> 23:59.640
He's always riding a shitty bike.

23:59.960 --> 24:01.240
Even if it's broken,

24:01.640 --> 24:03.920
he changes to another shitty bike.

24:04.200 --> 24:05.440
Ordinary corrupt officials

24:05.440 --> 24:06.200
don't need to

24:06.240 --> 24:07.960
disguise themselves to this extent.

24:07.960 --> 24:08.700
Look again.

24:08.740 --> 24:10.470
From 10 years ago to last month—

24:10.510 --> 24:11.920
whenever there's an interview,

24:11.920 --> 24:13.250
what does he emphasize?

24:14.920 --> 24:15.830
"I don't want to be an official.

24:15.830 --> 24:16.880
I am a scholar."

24:18.510 --> 24:19.750
Pretending to be so humble,

24:19.750 --> 24:21.880
how much money must he have embezzled?

24:22.590 --> 24:23.650
Does it make sense?

24:25.400 --> 24:26.200
It does.

24:26.920 --> 24:27.720
Let's get him.

24:45.450 --> 24:47.930
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

24:48.960 --> 24:50.220
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

24:51.710 --> 24:54.280
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

24:55.220 --> 24:56.570
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

25:10.030 --> 25:11.430
Park in the parking lot.

25:11.750 --> 25:13.680
Parking elsewhere is a fine of 200.

25:19.030 --> 25:19.720
Sorry.

26:13.160 --> 26:13.620
Bro,

26:14.640 --> 26:15.840
doesn't he live here?

26:16.160 --> 26:16.920
I know.

27:01.440 --> 27:01.920
Bro,

27:02.830 --> 27:04.090
can we find him?

27:04.550 --> 27:05.680
I am well-prepared.

27:32.750 --> 27:33.270
Bro,

27:34.270 --> 27:35.790
will our plan work?

27:36.680 --> 27:38.550
When God closes a door,

27:40.030 --> 27:41.880
he opens a window.

28:39.120 --> 28:40.670
[Fenglinwan Nightclub]

28:40.670 --> 28:44.670
[Fenglinwan]

28:44.480 --> 28:45.000
Stop the car.

28:44.700 --> 28:46.890
[Fenglinwan Hotel]

29:02.270 --> 29:02.930
She's here.

29:04.960 --> 29:05.480
Zhou Qi,

29:05.720 --> 29:07.200
the PR Manager of Fenglinwan Hotel.

29:07.200 --> 29:08.920
She'd intervened to mediate

29:09.030 --> 29:10.030
a few fights here,

29:10.110 --> 29:11.390
so we've met before.

29:11.920 --> 29:12.790
Ms. Zhou

29:13.200 --> 29:14.880
knows what to say and do.

29:15.070 --> 29:15.440
Okay.

29:16.160 --> 29:17.090
Hello, officer.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.480
Hello, officer.

29:19.270 --> 29:20.200
Hello, officer.

29:21.270 --> 29:22.240
Hello, Wang.

29:24.830 --> 29:25.890
Mind your manners.

29:26.270 --> 29:27.470
Hello, Officer Wang.

29:28.510 --> 29:29.640
This is Chief Zhang.

29:30.110 --> 29:30.750
Hello.

29:30.920 --> 29:31.590
We're here today

29:31.590 --> 29:32.350
because there are some situations

29:32.350 --> 29:33.510
we want to ask you about.

29:33.510 --> 29:35.110
I'll definitely cooperate.

29:35.310 --> 29:35.970
Have a seat.

29:39.720 --> 29:41.300
[Zhou Qi,
Fenglinwan Hotel's PR Manager]

29:46.310 --> 29:46.790
Chief.

29:49.030 --> 29:49.440
Chief.

29:52.830 --> 29:54.090
What we're asking you

29:54.440 --> 29:55.400
today

29:56.200 --> 29:57.200
must be forgotten

29:57.200 --> 29:58.130
or kept a secret.

29:58.480 --> 29:59.210
Understand?

30:00.030 --> 30:01.840
I'll 100% keep it a secret.

30:02.310 --> 30:03.760
I understand the rules.

30:04.270 --> 30:05.650
Whatever you ask,

30:05.680 --> 30:07.000
I'll answer honestly

30:07.160 --> 30:08.410
and fulfill my duty.

30:08.720 --> 30:09.750
Good, good.

30:15.350 --> 30:15.750
Chief,

30:16.110 --> 30:16.640
go ahead.

30:24.270 --> 30:25.330
Do you know Ye Jian?

30:26.590 --> 30:27.450
Captain Ye?

30:27.590 --> 30:28.200
Yes.

30:36.480 --> 30:37.590
Has Captain Ye been

30:37.640 --> 30:38.720
to Fenglinwan Hotel

30:38.720 --> 30:40.320
or your nightclub recently?

30:46.960 --> 30:47.690
Are you sure?

30:48.790 --> 30:50.120
I didn't see him anyway.

31:09.000 --> 31:10.240
Anything else?

31:16.400 --> 31:17.590
If not,

31:17.790 --> 31:19.720
officers, I'll head back first.

31:22.000 --> 31:22.510
Wait.

31:25.880 --> 31:26.550
If you think of

31:26.550 --> 31:27.350
anything suspicious,

31:27.350 --> 31:28.550
report to us anytime.

31:28.920 --> 31:29.520
Of course.

31:35.510 --> 31:36.240
Done asking?

31:37.110 --> 31:38.110
Do you have anything to ask?

31:38.110 --> 31:39.240
N-No, I don't.

31:40.240 --> 31:40.970
Neither do I.

31:42.110 --> 31:42.960
She looks like

31:43.000 --> 31:44.060
she came prepared.

31:48.440 --> 31:49.570
I want to see Lu Yibo.

31:49.830 --> 31:50.510
Make an appointment for me—

31:50.510 --> 31:51.110
right now.

32:02.070 --> 32:03.600
Can you still see anything?

32:07.070 --> 32:08.000
Can you find him?

32:12.590 --> 32:12.990
Got it.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.340
Can you hear me?

32:16.400 --> 32:17.270
Can you hear me?

32:17.920 --> 32:18.830
Found him.

32:21.400 --> 32:22.860
Is it the guy in the garden?

32:23.480 --> 32:24.230
Chief Huang.

32:24.470 --> 32:26.550
The signal at my house was bad just now.

32:26.550 --> 32:27.370
It's fine now.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.770
Go ahead.

32:29.110 --> 32:29.880
Fang,

32:30.350 --> 32:31.790
we are getting older.

32:32.240 --> 32:34.830
It's time to step back
and take care of our health.

32:34.830 --> 32:36.890
Don't you like doing cultural stuff?

32:36.920 --> 32:38.720
Switching to an easier job

32:38.960 --> 32:40.750
would make you happy, right?

32:42.790 --> 32:43.560
How's that?

32:43.590 --> 32:44.720
Are you so happy that

32:44.830 --> 32:45.960
you can't speak?

32:46.680 --> 32:47.140
Well...

32:47.440 --> 32:48.400
Why?

32:49.110 --> 32:51.030
We mainly considered how

32:51.110 --> 32:52.310
you've been diligent

32:52.400 --> 32:53.550
and hardworking all these years—

32:53.550 --> 32:54.840
it hasn't been easy.

32:54.960 --> 32:56.340
N-No, Chief Huang.

32:56.790 --> 32:58.850
I can really work for another 2 years.

32:59.640 --> 33:01.550
I've been fighting for a chance for you.

33:01.550 --> 33:03.410
And I finally got it this time.

33:04.310 --> 33:06.400
Why bother, Chief Huang?

33:07.200 --> 33:08.730
What are you talking about?

33:09.200 --> 33:10.880
You only have work in your heart.

33:10.880 --> 33:13.120
So I can't not have you in mine.

33:13.830 --> 33:14.440
Fang,

33:14.880 --> 33:16.620
wrap up your work nicely

33:16.920 --> 33:18.510
and get ready
to go to the provincial capital

33:18.510 --> 33:20.170
to do your cultural research.

33:24.880 --> 33:25.440
Fang?

33:26.480 --> 33:28.110
Why aren't you laughing?

33:32.110 --> 33:33.160
All right, all right.

33:33.160 --> 33:33.850
No need for

33:33.880 --> 33:34.790
words of gratitude.

33:34.790 --> 33:35.620
That's it.

33:42.270 --> 33:43.460
What is he doing?

33:43.790 --> 33:45.790
Looks like Five-Animal Exercises.

33:45.790 --> 33:47.250
He cares about his health.

33:50.590 --> 33:51.030
Bro,

33:51.790 --> 33:52.630
let's go.

33:52.920 --> 33:53.880
I'm hungry.

33:54.070 --> 33:55.930
Knowing where he lives is enough.

33:57.590 --> 33:58.200
We have to

33:58.200 --> 33:59.600
keep watch here tonight.

33:59.920 --> 34:00.720
That way, when he leaves tomorrow,

34:00.720 --> 34:01.850
we can make our move.

34:06.550 --> 34:07.280
Makes sense.

34:13.320 --> 34:14.000
Chief Zhang,

34:14.000 --> 34:15.530
how should we ask him later?

34:17.190 --> 34:18.960
Do you like
listening to Guo Degang's crosstalk?

34:18.960 --> 34:19.630
Yes.

34:19.710 --> 34:20.190
Yes?

34:21.230 --> 34:22.510
I heard that sometimes
when he's on stage with Yu Qian,

34:22.510 --> 34:23.150
they don't

34:23.190 --> 34:24.310
follow the script.

34:24.630 --> 34:25.440
Improvising?

34:25.840 --> 34:26.239
Right.

34:26.590 --> 34:27.230
All right then,

34:27.230 --> 34:28.000
as long as you deliver the setup,

34:28.000 --> 34:28.800
I'll play along.

34:28.800 --> 34:29.659
You sure? Okay.

34:33.280 --> 34:33.670
Please.

34:33.670 --> 34:34.130
Please.

34:38.030 --> 34:39.429
What a luxurious office.

34:40.030 --> 34:41.440
It's converted from a presidential suite.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.360
Have a seat, officers.

34:42.360 --> 34:42.760
Sit.

34:43.070 --> 34:43.510
Sit.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.840
If you're standing, we...

34:49.840 --> 34:50.480
Sit.

34:50.550 --> 34:51.320
I'll sit.

34:55.190 --> 34:55.920
Officers,

34:56.440 --> 34:57.570
what can I do for you?

34:58.110 --> 35:01.060
Well, we just saw each other recently

35:01.150 --> 35:02.360
at Captain Ye's memorial service,

35:02.360 --> 35:03.320
didn't we?

35:05.400 --> 35:05.800
Mr. Lu,

35:05.800 --> 35:07.000
guess why we're here.

35:11.230 --> 35:11.960
I don't know.

35:47.150 --> 35:48.350
I am a police officer!

35:48.440 --> 35:48.960
Listen to me!

35:48.960 --> 35:50.220
Don't run this way now.

35:50.280 --> 35:51.070
You, get out of the way.

35:51.070 --> 35:52.030
Don't go that way!

35:52.030 --> 35:52.770
Move!

35:52.840 --> 35:54.440
Go around! Go around!

36:05.840 --> 36:06.840
Don't take it out.

36:10.030 --> 36:11.630
I've been prepared for this.

36:13.190 --> 36:14.920
What's meant to come will come.

36:20.800 --> 36:23.000
You can take it out and see for yourself.

36:32.750 --> 36:33.660
Chief Zhang,

36:33.960 --> 36:35.000
a leader from the Provincial Department

36:35.000 --> 36:36.400
assigned to this special case.

36:36.400 --> 36:37.530
He came with clues,

36:37.880 --> 36:39.940
so it's all down to your attitude now.

36:48.960 --> 36:50.420
I wrote the report letter.

36:59.880 --> 37:01.480
You wrote the report letter?

37:01.870 --> 37:02.680
I didn't write it?

37:02.680 --> 37:03.910
You did.

37:07.400 --> 37:09.050
You aren't here for this?

37:09.110 --> 37:11.110
That's exactly what we are here for.

37:11.480 --> 37:12.440
This file...

37:12.480 --> 37:14.090
Your report letter

37:14.440 --> 37:15.540
has too many typos.

37:16.030 --> 37:17.800
You kept striking off
and writing over—it's illegible.

37:17.800 --> 37:18.440
We have to verify it

37:18.440 --> 37:19.550
with you in person.

37:21.320 --> 37:22.020
Yes.

37:22.230 --> 37:23.270
I was really

37:24.230 --> 37:25.630
too agitated at the time.

37:27.000 --> 37:28.130
Who killed Lu Zheng?

37:32.320 --> 37:33.180
I don't know.

37:33.320 --> 37:34.750
Then who did you report?

37:35.230 --> 37:37.160
You should at least remember that.

37:58.840 --> 38:00.370
The person I reported is...

38:08.280 --> 38:09.230
Who was it again?

38:09.920 --> 38:10.920
Let me tell you.

38:10.940 --> 38:12.070
I'm giving you a chance right now

38:12.070 --> 38:13.230
to make up for your crimes.

38:13.230 --> 38:14.230
If we didn't know the actual situation,

38:14.230 --> 38:15.280
would we come looking for you?

38:15.280 --> 38:17.880
If you don't want to talk,
we can talk at the station.

38:17.880 --> 38:19.960
Mr. Lu is our witness now.

38:20.110 --> 38:22.110
He is the key
to helping us solve the case.

38:22.110 --> 38:23.360
We can't treat witnesses

38:23.360 --> 38:24.760
like criminal suspects.

38:24.800 --> 38:25.280
You...

38:31.630 --> 38:32.590
Tell us yourself.

38:32.590 --> 38:33.190
Who is it?

38:40.800 --> 38:41.530
Chief Zhang.

38:44.800 --> 38:46.460
I need to think about it again.

